{"step_index":245,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:45:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T15:45:55+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T15:45:56+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":29,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (`4,967,609 B`, built in `3.20 s`, 100% V5-isolated) + `v6_spiderverse/textures/*` + `renders_v6/preview/*` are finalized and PIL-verified — ready for your `v6_sv_comp.py` -\\u003e `v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` + 26 stills + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + 3× 4s showcase clips!\\n\\n### 1. Render \\u0026 Performance Baseline (`v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`)\\n- **Engine \\u0026 Color**: `scene.eevee.use_raytracing = False`, `taa_render_samples = 16`, `motion_blur_shutter = 0.05`, `Standard` view transform (`exposure = 0.12`, end fade preserved).\\n- **1080p CPU Speed**: **`2.11–2.47 s/frame`** warm (`3.23 s` cold compile), `679` total objects, `0` root `Scene Collection` objects, `0` `.blend1` files.\\n\\n### 2. Master 3-Act Universe Property (`scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]`)\\n- Simply keyframe `scene['[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]']` (`0.0` = Act I Earth-1610 Miles; `1.0` = Act II Earth-65 Gwen; `2.0` = Act III Earth-928 2099; you can also spike e.g. `0.5`/`1.5` or compositor glitch on `f=788..790` \\u0026 `f=1601..1603` portal cuts).\\n- **Automatic Live Input-Socket Drivers** are already wired directly to `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]` across:\\n  - `V5_SkyDome` (3 full comic sky palettes + stepped sunburst rings + painterly cloud brush bands), `LGT_V5Sun` \\u0026 `LGT_V5SkyFill` color/energy;\\n  - `V5_Asphalt` \\u0026 `V5_Grass` (Act I indigo-slate/emerald -\\u003e Act II Gwen rose-teal/aquamarine watercolor wash -\\u003e Act III 2099 obsidian-ultraviolet);\\n  - `V5_LightStrip` \\u0026 `Mat_Neon_Cyan` (Act I electric cyan -\\u003e Act II Gwen hot pink/mint -\\u003e Act III 2099 laser crimson);\\n  - Every `NG_SV_ComicSurface` material (`SV Dimension` input socket shifts Prussian