SV_AeroRibbon_Cyan`, `MAT_SV_AeroRibbon_Mag` — each has Value node `nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"].outputs[0].default_value` (or keyframe `ob.scale` / `ob.rotation_euler` on 12fps Twos: e.g. scale `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` when `v \\u003c= 230 km/h`, `(1, 1..1.35, 1)` when `v \\u003e 230 km/h` + DRS boost!).\\n2. **Wheel-Spin Comic Smear Arcs** (parented to `Bone_Wheel_FL/FR/RL/RR`):\\n   - `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FR`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RR` -\\u003e material `MAT_SV_WheelSmear` (`nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"]` / `nodes[\\\"SV_FX_Emission\\\"].inputs[\\\"Strength\\\"]`).\\n3. **Exhaust Upshift/Backfire Star-Cone \\u0026 Floor Kerb Spark Slashes** (parented to `Bone_Body`):\\n   - `V6_FX_ExhaustCone` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_ExhaustBurst` (behind central titanium exhaust; step `ob.scale` on gear shifts / heavy-braking pops!).\\n   - `V6_FX_KerbSparks_L`, `V6_FX_KerbSparks_R` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_SparkSlashes` (under rear floor edges; step `ob.scale` from `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` to `(1.0..1.4)` on high-speed compression / `kerb_prox \\u003e 0.55`!).\\n\\n note: `v6_sv_build.py` leaves `scene.use_nodes = True` in saved `v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (only disabled during `--preview`), ready for your `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse` node tree!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:45:29\",\"request_id\":\"35acb76d-a929-4c5c-bd6f-79cd26a633f5\"}],\"head\":29}"}
