`, `render_v6_sv.py` -\\u003e `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend`, `1,281` frames / `24` Extreme Blockbuster Shots)**:\\n   - **Full 3D Rig Attitude (`XYZ + Heading + Pitch + Bank Roll`)**: Drive `Bone_Root` along `(racing_xy, racing_z + 0.012 * cos(bank))` and orient car smoothly to match 3D track tangent (`heading`, `pitch`) + `bank_deg` roll! Keep world trajectory \\u0026 cameras smooth `24 fps` while stepping car-local secondary dynamics \\u0026 3D FX on **Twos (`12 fps`)**!\\n   - **Redesign 24 Extreme Blockbuster Shots (`96` beats = `1,281` frames, fast ~2.2s cuts)**:\\n     * Ditch polite distant TV tripods! Use **`14–16 mm` asphalt-scraping front-wing/wheel hero angles (`0.18 m` off wet road, `16°` Dutch roll)** with skyscrapers towering overhead; **FPV vertical building-drop into diffuser exhaust flames**; **`300 mm` compressed blind-crest silhouette** against the giant horizon moon showering sparks; **`18°` banked upper-wall rail cam (`0.7 m` from wingtip)**; **laser-tunnel 180° whip-orbit -\\u003e blinding exit smash cut**; **dynamic FOV warp (`26 -\\u003e 15 mm`) on DRS/upshifts**; and **2-frame Black/White/Crimson Impact Frames** at the Tunnel-Exit Harbor Hairpin slam \\u0026 Eau-Rouge crest! Run automated 3D camera-to-car raycast check (`0` unintended obstructions!).\\n   - **Cinema-Scope `2.39:1` High-Contrast Spider-Verse Compositor**: Deep velvety blacks, punchy neon bloom, clearly visible `6–9 px` 1080p Ben-Day halftones, Earth-65 `Kuwahara` painterly skyline, Focal-Plane CMYK Misregistration, and sleek **`2.39:1` theatrical widescreen bars**!\\n   - Render **all 24 1080p stills** + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + **3× 4s (96-frame) showcase clips** (Clip 1: Canyon -\\u003e Eau-Rouge Spark Climb; Clip 2: Sky-Bridge -\\u003e 18° Banked Bowl -\\u003e Corkscrew Plunge; Clip 3: Laser Strobe Tunnel -\\u003e Harbor Hairpin Impact Frame!), sync docs, and hand off to `@sfx`!\\n\\n3) **`@sfx` (`pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py` + `mux_v6_sv.sh`)**:\\n   - Wait (`swarm